  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31435362",
      "title": "Adding a Header Button",
      "lectureOrder": 192,
      "videoOrder": 187,
      "sourceHash": "385b69a7db95ea7b00f4fc1520086801381f63e6516d89528e8916ac56d02ad5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.937,
          "end": 3.06,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.06,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "we can also switch between different screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 7.13,
          "en": "And for this, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.13,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "that I have a little plus button here in my headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 12.89,
          "en": "and that plus button should allow me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.89,
          "end": 15.453,
          "en": "to switch to the AddPlace screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.37,
          "end": 17.24,
          "en": "Now for this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.24,
          "end": 18.45,
          "en": "in our navigation setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.45,
          "end": 22.06,
          "en": "it's the AllPlaces screen where I wanna have this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.06,
          "end": 24.47,
          "en": "So therefore we can add some options to that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.47,
          "end": 26.893,
          "en": "with the options prop as you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.2,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "And it's the headerRght option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 31.24,
          "en": "which I wanna set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.24,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "because that allows me to add an item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 35.21,
          "en": "in the right corner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.21,
          "end": 37.733,
          "en": "or on the right side of the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.08,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "Now headerRight, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 43,
          "en": "takes a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43,
          "end": 45.2,
          "en": "a function which receives an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.2,
          "end": 46.28,
          "en": "which for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.28,
          "end": 48.36,
          "en": "gets information like the tintColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.36,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "of the item that will be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 53.5,
          "en": "which helps us with coloring that item correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 53.5,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "Now, the item which I do wanna render here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.8,
          "end": 58.933,
          "en": "should be a icon that is clickable or tappable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 59.93,
          "end": 62.57,
          "en": "Therefore I will add a new component for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.57,
          "end": 64.03,
          "en": "In the components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 64.03,
          "end": 66.013,
          "en": "I will add a new subfolder name UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 66.94,
          "end": 69.94,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a IconButton.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 69.94,
          "end": 72.7,
          "en": "And we added a component like this multiple times before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.7,
          "end": 74.03,
          "en": "in this course already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.03,
          "end": 76.4,
          "en": "but I still like doing this from scratch here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.4,
          "end": 77.99,
          "en": "to practice this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 77.99,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "So here I will,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 81.58,
          "en": "export my IconButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 81.58,
          "end": 82.45,
          "en": "And in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 82.45,
          "end": 84.72,
          "en": "that should be a icon that's pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 88.97,
          "en": "Therefore I will add Pressable here as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 88.97,
          "end": 92.17,
          "en": "and import Pressable from react-native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 92.17,
          "end": 96.61,
          "en": "And then I will import from @expo/vector-icons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 96.61,
          "end": 99.41,
          "en": "and import Ionicons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.41,
          "end": 102.65,
          "en": "And of course, you could use any other icon set as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 102.65,
          "end": 105.11,
          "en": "I just happen to like Ionicons quite a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 105.11,
          "end": 108.2,
          "en": "And then we can render an Ionicon icon like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.2,
          "end": 110.43299999999999,
          "en": "here in our Pressable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 111.59,
          "end": 114.93,
          "en": "Now this IconButton should be configurable from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 117.61,
          "en": "Hence, I will accept multiple props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 117.61,
          "end": 121.42,
          "en": "and I wanna get the exact icon name as a prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 121.42,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "through the icon prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 123.82,
          "end": 126.07,
          "en": "I wanna get the size as a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 126.07,
          "end": 127.75,
          "en": "and the color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 127.75,
          "end": 130.39,
          "en": "and also an onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 130.39,
          "end": 131.9,
          "en": "which we can forward",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.9,
          "end": 135.433,
          "en": "to the onPress prop of the Pressable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 138.64,
          "en": "And then on the icon itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.64,
          "end": 140.28,
          "en": "we have to set the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 140.28,
          "end": 142.34,
          "en": "and I will set this to icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.34,
          "end": 145.13,
          "en": "because I expect to get the name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 145.13,
          "end": 147.63,
          "en": "And we can set the size to size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 147.63,
          "end": 150.773,
          "en": "and the color to the color we're receiving.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 152.57,
          "end": 153.96,
          "en": "Now, we also need some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 154.793,
          "en": "that are baked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 154.793,
          "end": 155.81,
          "en": "into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 155.81,
          "end": 157.73,
          "en": "Hence, we will use the StyleSheet here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 157.73,
          "end": 159.313,
          "en": "to create a new StyleSheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 160.66,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "And then for the styles that should be set up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.16,
          "en": "I will add a button style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 165.16,
          "end": 167.41,
          "en": "and a pressed style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 167.41,
          "end": 170.74,
          "en": "which will be applied when this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 170.74,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "And for the general button style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 174.7,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we have some padding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 174.7,
          "end": 176.25,
          "en": "in all directions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 179.23,
          "en": "and some margin in all directions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 179.23,
          "end": 180.63,
          "en": "And of course you can play around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 183.903,
          "en": "with these styles to get exactly the look you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 185.29,
          "end": 187.55,
          "en": "And I will add justifyContent center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 187.55,
          "end": 189.62,
          "en": "and alignItems center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 189.62,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "to make sure that we center this icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 193.45,
          "en": "in the middle of this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 194.75,
          "end": 195.74,
          "en": "Now for pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 195.74,
          "end": 199.46,
          "en": "I just want to set the opacity to 0.7 let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 199.46,
          "end": 201.393,
          "en": "to make it slightly transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 202.54,
          "end": 205.13,
          "en": "And now these styles can be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 205.13,
          "end": 206.36,
          "en": "and to the container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 206.36,
          "end": 208.42000000000002,
          "en": "so to the Pressable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 208.42000000000002,
          "end": 211.44,
          "en": "I will add styles.button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 211.44,
          "end": 215.03,
          "en": "and I also wanna add the pressed style when this is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 215.03,
          "end": 217.31,
          "en": "Hence I will actually wrap this into an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 217.31,
          "end": 219.21,
          "en": "into square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 219.21,
          "end": 221.53,
          "en": "and always add the button style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 221.53,
          "end": 223.31,
          "en": "But as a second array element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 223.31,
          "end": 226.55,
          "en": "I will sometimes add the pressed style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 226.55,
          "end": 228.65,
          "en": "if pressed is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 228.65,
          "end": 232.07,
          "en": "And pressed is a property we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 232.07,
          "end": 235.36,
          "en": "if we turn this style value into a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 235.36,
          "end": 237.41,
          "en": "because then this function will be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 237.41,
          "end": 239.55,
          "en": "for us by Pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 239.55,
          "end": 243.16,
          "en": "And we will receive an object that has a pressed property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 243.16,
          "end": 246.28,
          "en": "that indicates by being true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 246.28,
          "end": 248.88,
          "en": "whether this is currently being pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 248.88,
          "end": 250.64600000000002,
          "en": "And if this is being pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 250.64600000000002,
          "end": 254.713,
          "en": "I want to add the pressed style like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 255.99,
          "end": 258.963,
          "en": "We don't need to add any extra styling to the icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 260.41,
          "end": 263.03,
          "en": "So that is now my icon button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 263.03,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "And this icon button can now be used in App.js here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 267.663,
          "en": "in header right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 268.7,
          "end": 273.1,
          "en": "There, I wanna display such a IconButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 273.1,
          "end": 276.97,
          "en": "So therefore it must be imported of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 276.97,
          "end": 278.65999999999997,
          "en": "And then on this icon button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 278.65999999999997,
          "end": 281.653,
          "en": "we have to set all these props that are expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 282.51,
          "end": 284.24,
          "en": "For example, the icon prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 284.24,
          "end": 285.64,
          "en": "which I will set to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 285.64,
          "end": 288.42,
          "en": "which is one of the supported icon names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 290.64,
          "en": "supported by Ionicons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 290.64,
          "end": 293.944,
          "en": "And you can always check this @expo/vector-icons page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 293.944,
          "end": 297.163,
          "en": "which gives you an overview of all the supported icons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 298.33,
          "end": 301.13,
          "en": "Now I'll set the size prop to 24",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 301.13,
          "end": 304.77,
          "en": "and the color prop to this tintColor which we're getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 304.77,
          "end": 308.2,
          "en": "so that we use the color that is identified",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 308.2,
          "end": 310.96,
          "en": "as the to-be used color by the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 310.96,
          "end": 312.653,
          "en": "and by React navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 314.13,
          "end": 316.59,
          "en": "And for onPress here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 316.59,
          "end": 319.23,
          "en": "I will use another inline function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 319.23,
          "end": 321.61,
          "en": "which should make sure that we navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 321.61,
          "end": 326.06,
          "en": "to this AddPlace screen when this button is pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 326.06,
          "end": 328.01,
          "en": "and to make sure that this happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 328.01,
          "end": 332.83,
          "en": "we need to get access to the navigation object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 332.83,
          "end": 336,
          "en": "which is provided via React navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 336,
          "end": 339.40999999999997,
          "en": "Now we get this as a prop in all screen components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 339.40999999999997,
          "end": 342.9,
          "en": "we can get it with the useNavigation hook as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 342.9,
          "end": 344.43,
          "en": "but we can also get it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 344.43,
          "end": 348.12,
          "en": "by converting our options here from a static object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 348.12,
          "end": 352.5,
          "en": "to a function that returns such a object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 352.5,
          "end": 354.49,
          "en": "For this we should wrap the curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 354.49,
          "end": 356.83,
          "en": "that define the object into brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 356.83,
          "end": 359.51,
          "en": "to make it clear that this is a object being returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
